{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16161","headline":"赠华州郑大夫 · 王建","name":"赠华州郑大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此官出入凤池头，通化门前第一州。\n少华山云当驿起，小敷溪水入城流。\n空闲地内人初满，词讼牌前草渐稠。\n报状拆开知足雨，赦书宣过喜无囚。\n自来不说双旌贵，恐替长教百姓愁。\n公退晚凉无一事，步行携客上南楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}